<div class="sec-head" id="sec-curves">
  <div class="sec-num">1</div>
  <h2>The Epidemic Curve: Why It Rises, Peaks, and Falls</h2>
  <p>The bell-shaped I(t) curve is entirely determined by the balance between new infections \(\beta S I / N\) and recoveries \(\gamma I\). The S(t) curve is the key — when it crosses below \(1/\mathcal{R}_0\), the epidemic turns.</p>
</div>

