  <h2>R&#8337;(t) — The Effective Reproduction Number Over Time</h2>
  <p>\(\mathcal{R}_e(t) = \mathcal{R}_0 \times S(t)/N\). It starts at \(\mathcal{R}_0\), crosses 1 at the epidemic peak, and falls toward 0 as susceptibles are depleted. This is the real-time metric used by public health agencies.</p>
</div>

