<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 3 — EPIDEMIC vs ENDEMIC
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="sec-head" id="sec-endemic">
  <div class="sec-num">3</div>
  <h2>Epidemic vs Endemic — Side by Side</h2>
  <p>The only structural difference is \(\mu N\) (births) replenishing S. Without it, S depletes to zero and the epidemic self-extinguishes. With it, S stabilises at \(S^* = 1/\mathcal{R}_0\) forever.</p>
</div>

